E","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: Godot 4.3 stable\n- Reproducible in: Godot 4.6.1 stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.6.1.stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nAnimating ```FontVariation``` properties of a Label font causes continuous growth in both:\n\n```Performance.OBJECT_COUNT``` and ```Performance.MEMORY_STATIC```\n\nThe growth happens while the animation is running.\nWhen the animation stops, the growth stops as well.\n\nHowever, the created objects and memory usage do not return to previous levels, suggesting continuous allocations during the animation.\n\nA minimal scene with very few nodes can reach thousands of objects quickly when the animation plays.\n\nA video demonstrating the issue (by changing the embolden | Godot 4.6.1) is attached.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2dd77b68-3ab8-4b9a-ac2d-0dc9d445ab23\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a ```Control``` scene\n- Add a ```Label```\n- Set the font to a ```FontVariation``` (It needs to be local if you are using Animation Player)\n<img width=\"315\" height=\"57\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2da7acd1-1a2b-4a27-ac99-92c27ca767ca\" />\n\n- Create a ```animationPlayer``` ( or do a tween by code )\n\n- Create a ```animation``` that changes any value of the ```FontVariation``` Variations\n<img width=\"348\" height=\"348\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ca90369-7606-4401-a538-1932cb4259f6\" />\n\n- Start the animation (either by code or autoplay on load)\n\nResult:\n- Object count and memory continuously increase while the animation runs.\n\n- Stopping the animation stops the growth, but the objects remain allocated.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-report.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25824212/bug-report.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"FefeLina","id":109309271,"node_id":"U_kgDOBoPtVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109309271?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina","html_url":"https://github.com/FefeLina","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FefeLina/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117213/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}